<title>USA: Baldwin &amp; Lyons Inc Q1 oper net down.</title>
<headline>Baldwin &amp; Lyons Inc Q1 oper net down.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $0.22		    $0.26</p>
<p> Oper net		   3,034		    3,893</p>
<p> Revs			23,755		   21,187</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  14,063		   14,597</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: First quarter 1997 results exclude realized net gains on investments of $3.5 million, or $.25 per share, compared to realized net gains of $.03 per share for the 1996 first quarter. 1996 first quarter also exludes $0.02 a share in income from the company's former real estate development subsidiary.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
